---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="operational-context">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow boxed">Core Philosophy</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Fully Kept, <br /><span class="gold-text">At Any Level.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead">Every business moves at its own pace. Your financial needs are unique, and standard accounting rarely fits perfectly. bkept operates as a full-spectrum financial partner designed to meet you exactly where you are.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="card top-gold lift">
      <Icon name="layers" />
      <h4>Flexible Integration</h4>
      <p>You do not need to overhaul your entire business to work with us. You dictate the level of procedure and commitment; we ensure the output is standardized.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card top-gold lift">
      <Icon name="target" />
      <h4>Precision Execution</h4>
      <p>If you only need complex variance reporting, we build the models. If you just want foundational categorization, we manage the ledger. We scale to your exact friction points.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card top-gold lift">
      <Icon name="trend" />
      <h4>Adaptable Operations</h4>
      <p>From establishing basic ledger integrity to driving high-level advisory and 13-week cash flow forecasting, we tailor our involvement to your exact operational maturity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
